; weeks' trades by the order desk's commands in both pockets, its switch among them, 98 orders, 97
; filled, one a sale of shares the pocket held none of; four prospectuses proofread on Gigs;
; every view looked at; then the market let run to the first quarter's card, the firm's +5.80%
